# The runtime data directory only — the SQLite file, the local cube, anything
# written while the app runs. Anchored with a leading slash on purpose: written
# as a bare "data/" it also matched server/data/, which is source, and those
# four files never reached the repository. A clean deploy then died on
# ERR_MODULE_NOT_FOUND for server/data/index.js.
/data/

